<title>HONG KONG: Trading of Peace Hill shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading of Peace Hill shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of beverages maker and distributor Peace Hill Enterprise Group Ltd was suspended in the morning at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Monday.  </p>
<p>Peace Hill shares closed Friday at HK$3.525, up 2.5 cents from Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6369</p>
